{"id":"principalement","lemma":"principalement","pos":"adv","rank":4551,"glosses":["mainly, principally"],"ipa":"/pʁɛ̃.si.pal.mɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/6b/Fr-principalement.ogg/Fr-principalement.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"C'était principalement des femmes.","en":"They were mostly women.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null,{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},{"g":"woman","l":"femme"}]},{"text":"Cette partie de la ville est principalement résidentielle.","en":"This part of town is mainly residential.","words":[{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},{"g":"part"},null,null,{"g":"town, city"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,{"g":"residential","l":"résidentiel"}],"phrases":[[2,4,"of the"]]},{"text":"Le succès dépend principalement de l'effort.","en":"Success depends mostly on effort.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"success"},{"g":"to depend","l":"dépendre"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"effort"}]},{"text":"Son succès a été principalement dû à la bonne fortune.","en":"His success was mostly due to good luck.","words":[{"g":"his, her, its"},{"g":"success"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"summer"},null,{"g":"must","l":"devoir"},null,null,{"g":"good","l":"bon"},{"g":"fortune"}],"phrases":[[6,8,"a la"]]},{"text":"L'assistance se composait principalement d'étudiants.","en":"The audience consisted mainly of students.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"assistance"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to compose","l":"composer"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"studying","l":"étudiant"}]}]}